      ":question/problem": "A person completed two exercises: squats and push-ups, burning a total of $480$ calories. Due to corrections in form, the calorie burn of squats was reduced by $25%$ and the calorie burn of push-ups was reduced by $40%$. After the reductions, the combined energy expenditure was $348$ calories. Which system of equations gives the original calories $s$ burned by squats and $p$ burned by push-ups?"
